<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!--
CycloneDDS config for a DoppelTest vehicle container. Derived from the 0.52.0
image's /home/aw/cyclonedds.xml, with two changes.

1. MaxAutoParticipantIndex. Discovery is pinned to `lo`, which is not
   multicast-capable, so Cyclone disables multicast -- and with multicast off
   `ParticipantIndex: none` cannot use ephemeral ports and degrades to `auto`,
   scanning indices 0..MaxAutoParticipantIndex. That default is 9, so the 10th
   participant dies with "Failed to find a free participant index". Autoware
   0.52.0 launches ~45 processes, each a participant, so most of the stack
   aborts and the launch is left with no planner. The symptom is
   `rmw_create_node: failed to create domain`, which reads like a DDS
   misconfiguration rather than a quota.

2. SocketReceiveBufferSize. The image demands min="10MB"; Cyclone treats an
   unmet minimum as fatal, and net.core.rmem_max is a host-wide setting a
   container cannot raise. Dropping the element falls back to "default", which
   warns and continues.

ROS_LOCALHOST_ONLY must be UNSET when this file is used: it injects a second
NetworkInterface (address 127.0.0.1) and Cyclone then refuses with "lo: the
same interface may not be selected twice", selecting no interface at all.
Isolation between vehicles does not depend on it -- each vehicle is its own
container, hence its own network namespace, and DDS never leaves that lo.
-->
<CycloneDDS xmlns="https://cdds.io/config" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
            xsi:schemaLocation="https://cdds.io/config https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds/master/etc/cyclonedds.xsd">
  <Domain Id="any">
    <Discovery>
      <ParticipantIndex>auto</ParticipantIndex>
      <MaxAutoParticipantIndex>250</MaxAutoParticipantIndex>
    </Discovery>
    <General>
      <Interfaces>
        <NetworkInterface name="lo" priority="default" multicast="default"/>
      </Interfaces>
      <AllowMulticast>default</AllowMulticast>
      <MaxMessageSize>65500B</MaxMessageSize>
    </General>
    <Internal>
      <Watermarks>
        <WhcHigh>500kB</WhcHigh>
      </Watermarks>
    </Internal>
  </Domain>
</CycloneDDS>
